 "page_content": "<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ts-corp\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ts-corp\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ts-corp__hero\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ts-corp__hero\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ts-corp__eyebrow\"} -->\n<p class=\"ts-corp__eyebrow\">Corporate &amp; group massage · Portland</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Corporate &amp; Group Massage in Portland</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ts-corp__lead\"} -->\n<p class=\"ts-corp__lead\">A thoughtful way to appreciate your team.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>I offer on-site chair massage for employee appreciation days, workplace events and group occasions. Tell me your time block, how many people will take part and where the event is, and I will plan an arrangement that fits and send you a quote.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"className\":\"ts-corp__actions\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons ts-corp__actions\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"mailto:butsabad@gmail.com?subject=Corporate%20massage%20quote%20request&amp;body=Hi%20Butsaba%2C%0A%0AI%20would%20like%20a%20quote%20for%20a%20corporate%20massage%20event.%0A%0AOrganization%3A%0AContact%20name%20and%20phone%3A%0AEvent%20date%20%28or%20%22flexible%22%29%3A%0AEvent%20location%20%28venue%20and%20city%29%3A%0AApproximate%20number%20of%20participants%3A%0AService%20hours%20requested%20%28for%20example%203%20or%205%29%3A%0AMassage%20type%20%28chair%20massage%2C%20table%20massage%2C%20or%20not%20sure%20yet%29%3A%0AAnything%20else%20I%20should%20know%3A%0A\">Request a Corporate Massage Quote</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button -->\n<!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"#booking-options\">See booking options</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ts-corp__fine\"} -->\n<p class=\"ts-corp__fine\">Arranged through an organization or venue at a shared location. I do not make individual home visits.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"ts-corp__glance\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns ts-corp__glance\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ts-corp__card-title\"} -->\n<p class=\"ts-corp__card-title\">Chair massage for teams</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Short appointments for employee appreciation days and workplace events.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ts-corp__card-title\"} -->\n<p class=\"ts-corp__card-title\">Three- or five-hour booking blocks</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Plan around the time your organization can set aside.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ts-corp__card-title\"} -->\n<p class=\"ts-corp__card-title\">Table massage by arrangement</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Considered when the host can provide a suitable private room and the details are agreed in advance.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"anchor\":\"chair-massage\",\"className\":\"ts-corp__section\"} -->\n<div id=\"chair-massage\" class=\"wp-block-group ts-corp__section\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ts-corp__eyebrow\"} -->\n<p class=\"ts-corp__eyebrow\">The main offer</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Chair Massage for Employee Appreciation</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Chair massage is a practical fit for employee appreciation days and workplace events. You set aside a block of time, and each person takes a short appointment during the event. I plan sessions at about 10–15 minutes per person, depending on your schedule and how many people take part.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ts-corp__note\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ts-corp__note\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A three-hour booking can often fit around 12–15 short appointments.</strong> The final number depends on appointment length, transitions, setup and any break time, so I will agree a realistic schedule with you before confirming the event. Please read this as a planning estimate, not a promise.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Planning a five-hour block? The number of appointments depends on session length and the schedule, so I work it out with you in your quote.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"anchor\":\"table-massage\",\"className\":\"ts-corp__section\"} -->\n<div id=\"table-massage\" class=\"wp-block-group ts-corp__section\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ts-corp__eyebrow\"} -->\n<p class=\"ts-corp__eyebrow\">By arrangement</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Table Massage at Suitable Venues</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For hotels, senior-living communities and other organizations with a suitable private room, table massage may also be possible. The host and I would talk through room privacy, space, access, equipment, timing and the kind of appointments being requested before deciding whether it is a good fit.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Table massage is arranged through the host organization at its own venue, not as individual home visits. I confirm session lengths and pricing for table massage in your quote.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"anchor\":\"booking-options\",\"className\":\"ts-corp__section ts-corp__booking\"} -->\n<div id=\"booking-options\" class=\"wp-block-group ts-corp__section ts-corp__booking\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ts-corp__eyebrow\"} -->\n<p class=\"ts-corp__eyebrow\">Booking and price</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Plan the Time That Works for Your Team</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ts-corp__rate\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ts-corp__rate\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ts-corp__rate-line\"} -->\n<p class=\"ts-corp__rate-line\"><strong>$130</strong> per service hour</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ts-corp__rate-note\"} -->\n<p class=\"ts-corp__rate-note\">Proposed corporate rate. What the billed time includes is confirmed in your written quote.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"ts-corp__blocks\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns ts-corp__blocks\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3-hour block</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>About 12–15 short chair-massage appointments, as an estimate. The exact schedule is agreed before the event is confirmed.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">5-hour block</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The number of appointments is set in your quote, once session length and the schedule are agreed.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Final pricing is confirmed in a written quote after the service format, event timing, venue and inclusions have been agreed.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ts-corp__section\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ts-corp__section\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ts-corp__eyebrow\"} -->\n<p class=\"ts-corp__eyebrow\">Before the event</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What I’ll Plan With You</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Before I confirm an event, I go over the practical details with you:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Event location, access and parking</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The time block and the number of participants</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Where the chair massage will be set up</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>How employees will sign up or be scheduled</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Whether a private room is available, if table massage is of interest</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Arrival, setup and pack-down timing</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Any venue policies or paperwork you need from me</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>I will confirm the space and setup requirements with you before the event.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ts-corp__section\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ts-corp__section\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ts-corp__eyebrow\"} -->\n<p class=\"ts-corp__eyebrow\">How it works</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Three Steps to a Quote</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"ts-corp__steps\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns ts-corp__steps\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ts-corp__num\"} -->\n<p class=\"ts-corp__num\">1</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tell me about your event</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Share the date, venue, number of people and the time block.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ts-corp__num\"} -->\n<p class=\"ts-corp__num\">2</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Plan the schedule</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You and I talk through chair or table massage, approximate session length, setup and event logistics.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ts-corp__num\"} -->\n<p class=\"ts-corp__num\">3</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Receive a quote</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Once the details are clear, I send a written quote with the proposed arrangement and price for your approval.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ts-corp__section ts-corp__about\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ts-corp__section ts-corp__about\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ts-corp__eyebrow\"} -->\n<p class=\"ts-corp__eyebrow\">Who you will work with</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">About Butsaba</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>I am Butsaba Dusrai, an Oregon licensed massage therapist (LMT-29905). I have practiced massage since 2020 and trained in traditional Thai bodywork at Still Light Center. When you write to me, I plan your event and prepare your quote myself. <a href=\"/about/\">Read more about me</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:uagb/adva