 "faq_text": "What kinds of events do you serve? Employee appreciation days, workplace events and other group occasions where the host can arrange a suitable space and schedule. Do you offer individual home visits? No. This service is arranged through an organization or venue at a shared location. How many employees can receive massage in three hours? A three-hour event can often fit around 12–15 short chair-massage appointments, depending on session length, transitions and setup. I will plan the schedule with you before confirming the event. Can you do table massage? Table massage may be possible at a suitable host venue with an appropriate private room. I will talk through the setting and the arrangement with you first. What does it cost? The proposed corporate rate is $130 per service hour. A written quote confirms the total and what is included. What does the host need to provide? Tell me what space is available and what the venue requires. I will go over setup and scheduling with you before the event. How do I reserve a date? Send an inquiry with your preferred date and event details. A date is not confirmed until availability, the arrangement, the price and any agreed booking terms have been confirmed.",
